---
import Head from "../components/Head.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import "../styles/fabric-in-motion.css";
---

<html>
  <Head
    title="Tire Calligraphy - Fabric in Motion campaign"
    url="https://tirecalli.com/fabric-in-motion-campaign"
    description="Tire Calligraphy presents Fabric in Motion - A visual, audio and tactile experience. Spring symbolizes a change of energies, out with the old – in with the new."
  />
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main class="overflow-hidden">
      <section class="fim-hero">
        <img
          class="fim-hero__img"
          src="/img/campaign/buto-dance/denim-jacket-scene.webp"
          alt="Butoh dance denim jacket scene"
        />
        <h1 class="fim-hero__title">
          <div class="fim-hero__span-container-1">
            <span>Fabric</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fim-hero__span-container-2">
            <span>in</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fim-hero__span-container-3">
            <span>Motion</span>
          </div>
        </h1>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-statement" id="fimStatement">
        <h2 class="fim-statement__text">
          A visual, audio and tactile experience.
        </h2>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-video">
        <video
          class="fim-video__player"
          src="https://res.cloudinary.com/snsa-kscc/video/upload/buto-dance.mp4"
          controls
          playsinline
          autoplay
          muted
          loop></video>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-heading">
        <h1>Butoh</h1>
        <p class="text--lg">
          Spring symbolizes a change of energies, out with the old – in with the
          new...
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-nature fim-item">
        <div class="fim-nature__group-left">
          <img
            src="/img/conversation/iva-dance-location.webp"
            alt="Dance location"
          />
          <img
            src="/img/conversation/iva-buto-profile-2.webp"
            alt="Butoh dancer profile"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="fim-nature__group-right">
          <h4>The Dance of Darkness</h4>
          <div class="fim-nature__copy text--lg">
            <p>
              "The dance is rooted in a deep connection with the natural world.
              Nature is a symbol of a shifting existence, and the transformation
              and transience of nature and the cycle of the seasons are often
              incorporated into the 'patterns' of butoh dance."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-why fim-item">
        <div class="fim-why__group-left">
          <h4>Why Butoh?</h4>
          <img
            src="/img/conversation/iva-dancer-detail-1.webp"
            alt="Dancer detail"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="fim-why__group-right">
          <div class="fim-why__list">
            <p>
              <span class="fim-why__bullet"></span> Butoh is <span class="bold"
                >energetic</span
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <span class="fim-why__bullet"></span> Butoh is <span class="bold"
                >crude</span
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <span class="fim-why__bullet"></span> Butoh is <span class="bold"
                >raw</span
              >
            </p>
            <p class="fim-why__accent">...Like the Denim</p>
            <p>
              <span class="fim-why__bullet"></span> Butoh is <span class="bold"
                >expressional</span
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <span class="fim-why__bullet"></span> Butoh is <span class="bold"
                >emotional</span
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <span class="fim-why__bullet"></span> Butoh sometimes flows like the
              <span class="bold">light</span>
            </p>
            <p class="fim-why__accent">
              ...Like the "white", that is fragility
            </p>
            <p class="fim-why__accent">...Like Cotton, (which is The Source)</p>
          </div>
          <img
            src="/img/conversation/iva-dancer-detail-2.webp"
            alt="Dancer detail"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-gallery">
        <img
          src="/img/conversation/iva-buto-profile-4.webp"
          alt="Butoh dancer profile"
        />
      </section>

      <section class="fim-heading fim-heading--dark">
        <h1>Denim</h1>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-description">
        <div class="fim-description__content">
          <div class="fim-description__item">
            <div class="fim-description__counter">01</div>
            <div class="fim-description__text">
              <p>
                With a vision of neutral, universal items in mind, 199144
                (premium) items will spread through the seasons not constrained
                by time, location or fashion trends.
              </p>
              <p class="fim-description__highlight">
                Every item offered is a neutral-gender item.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fim-description__item">
            <div class="fim-description__counter">02</div>
            <div class="fim-description__text">
              <p>
                Black denim was chosen as key source, signifying the key source
                that is present in each city, this being concrete and asphalt,
                dark and sturdy, resisting the elements but also accepting them.
              </p>
              <p>
                Even with all of its lights, the city is a dark place with all
                the concrete walls and glass of skyscrapers, the streets, the
                subway lanes.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fim-description__item">
            <div class="fim-description__counter">03</div>
            <div class="fim-description__text">
              <p>
                The raw black denim in all its roughness will start to adapt to
                each individual, becoming a unique item in fit and color, both
                being noticeable, but maybe just at the second or third glance.
              </p>
              <p>
                The offering was presented as a uniform, a Basic Denim Overall
                Pant and a Basic Denim Jacket – as a layer of the Hybrid Jacket.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fim-description__item">
            <div class="fim-description__counter">04</div>
            <div class="fim-description__text">
              <p>
                Being neutral in color, fit and minimal in (visible) features,
                items, each in its own right, are envisioned and created as
                adaptable to each other and additional garments.
              </p>
              <p class="fim-description__highlight">
                Thus serving each individual when creating their looks, a
                uniform of a sort.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <img
          class="fim-description__bg"
          src="/img/campaign/buto-dance/denim-jacket-scene.webp"
          alt="Denim jacket"
        />
      </section>

      <section class="fim-products fim-item">
        <div class="fim-products__group-left">
          <p class="text--xxl">
            With a utilitarian approach to wardrobe the items are presented as
            spacey, oversized if you will, a comfortable wear.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="fim-products__group-right">
          <img
            src="/img/Basic-Denim-Overall-Pant/basic-denim-overall-pant-strap-buckle-detail.webp"
            alt="Basic denim overall pant detail"
          />
          <img
            src="/img/Basic-Denim-Jacket/basic-denim-jacket-front-detail.webp"
            alt="Basic denim jacket detail"
          />
          <img
            src="/img/Hybrid-Jacket/girl-in-hybrid-winter-jacket-front-detail.webp"
            alt="Hybrid jacket detail"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-heading">
        <h1>199144</h1>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-crewneck fim-item">
        <div class="fim-crewneck__group-left">
          <h4>Reflective Calli Crewneck</h4>
          <div class="fim-crewneck__copy text--lg">
            <p>
              This gender-neutral crew was a first piece in our new 199144
              collection. Inspired by Japanese culture and its minimalism and a
              sense of calm.
            </p>
            <p>
              With an ambition to be as plain and minimal as possible, it still
              provides much needed details revealed only by the second or third
              look, such as the "199144" white embroidered logo on the chest, or
              the full "Tire Calligraphy" logo in silver on the back, coming
              fully to life when "attacked" by a force of light, as it is a 3M
              reflective element.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fim-crewneck__group-right">
          <img
            src="/img/Reflective-Calli-Crewneck/tire-calligraphy-199144-embroidery.webp"
            alt="199144 embroidery detail"
          />
          <img
            src="/img/Reflective-Calli-Crewneck/white-reflective-crewneck-back-detail.webp"
            alt="Reflective crewneck back"
          />
          <img
            src="/img/Reflective-Calli-Crewneck/white-reflective-crewneck-back-detail-dark.webp"
            alt="Reflective detail in dark"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="fim-outro">
        <div class="fim-outro__content">
          <p class="text--xxl">
            The black denim pieces juxtaposed with the white on white
            "maxi-minimal" aesthetics goes perfectly hand in hand with the clean
            minimal aesthetics.
          </p>
          <p class="text--lg mt">
            In this way juxtaposing the cold and the warmth, that are both
            visual (cold) and on the other hand tactile (warm), so a full
            experience indeed was provided to the audience which was fully
            immersed in the offering of both <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/holographik.space/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text--white">The Space</a
            > and <a
              href="/crypto-kids-campaign/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text--white">The Collection</a
            >
            through an immersive experience that is a butoh-esque performance as a
            pinnacle of the evening.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="fim-outro__cta">
          <a href="/shop">
            <h2 class="centered text--white">Explore The Collection</h2>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
    <script src="../js/app.js"></script>
    <script src="../js/app-fabric-in-motion.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
